  "reading": {
   "title": "School events in October",
   "text": "Lincoln Elementary has many events in October. Mr. Brown writes them on the school calendar. On Monday, October 6, there is an assembly in the gym at 9:00. The principal talks about the new school rules. On Thursday, October 16, parents come to the school for the parent-teacher conferences at 4:30. On Friday, October 24, the fourth grade has a field trip to a farm. The bus leaves at 8:15 in the morning.\n\nHafsa wants to help. She is going to volunteer at the Fall Festival on Saturday, October 25. The festival starts at noon, and it is in the school parking lot. \"Please come early,\" says Mr. Brown. \"We need help at ten o'clock.\" Hafsa writes the dates in her calendar and smiles.",
